      "content": "I get what you're saying about being careful, but I've actually spoken to a few local staff members who said it's a common way to talk about hard work and perseverance in the region. They seemed to think it was quite endearing. I'm really leaning towards using it because it feels so much more authentic than \"the vibrancy of the local way of life\"—which honestly sounds like something out of a textbook. Are you sure there's a risk here? I'd hate to pass up a genuine moment of connection just because of a potential misunderstanding.",
